.jpg\",\"rating\":5.5,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.42000000000000004,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":217695,\"title\":\"The Woodland Workshop\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eAJbnzDN6zemQ9fxLX26MRkiJvs.jpg\",\"rating\":2,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4076923076923077,\"_genreOverlap\":1}],\"seasonNumber\":13,\"seasonName\":\"Season 13\",\"seasonOverview\":\"\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/A2cT0MxCHTIBrZIve5hZj0nAizF.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2019-09-16\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Smartphone Amp\",\"overview\":\"This clever project boosts the sound coming from your smartphone. And all it takes is a little creative work at the band saw.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-09-16\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Wall Cabinet\",\"overview\":\"Store and display your favorite treasures in a cabinet that breaks the mold of traditional storage.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-09-23\",\"runtime\":26},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Simple Shop Storage\",\"overview\":\"This simple storage shelf is great for a workshop, a garage, or any other place where you want to keep things close by — yet out of the way. This wall-mounted station will ensure that all your cordless drills are fully charged and ready to go at a moment’s notice.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-09-30\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Bride's Chest\",\"overview\":\"Functionality and beauty combine in this classic piece of American fine furniture. Best of all, it’s every bit as practical as it is attractive.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-10-07\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Miterless Picture Frames\",\"overview\":\"Surprising things come in small packages. These frames are the perfect example of a nice woodworking exercise and gift ideas rolled into one.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-10-14\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Hardware Organizer Cart\",\"overview\":\"With simple plywood construction and a wide range of storage options, this cart holds a lot of supplies and lets you roll them right to the job at hand.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-10-21\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Trestle Hall Table\",\"overview\":\"This versatile table is a great addition to any space, casual or formal. As well as the faithful companion to your sofa, it can serve many ways.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-10-21\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Cutting Board\",\"overview\":\"With multiple design options, this cutting board has universal appeal. You can choose from one of our four designs or create your own.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-10-28\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Step-Back Bookcase\",\"overview\":\"This stylish bookcase consists of a large center case flanked by two smaller cases. You can build all three or just the main case.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-11-04\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Shop-Made Clamps\",\"overview\":\"Save money and solve unique clamping challenges by building your own clamps.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-11-11\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"Adjustable Stool\",\"overview\":\"Sit in comfort at your workbench on this adjustable-height stool. Curved legs and metal footrests add good looks and stability.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-11-18\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"Barnwood Entry Bench\",\"overview\":\"Storage is the order of the day with this hall bench. But the detail that will most likely catch your eye is the reclaimed barn boards that are used for the back and door panel.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\